  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2fabfc503d1abde4ab2527103056f87a, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPC4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  lines:
  - "Ch\xE0o d\u0169ng s\u0129."
  - "B\xEAn kia s\xF4ng l\xE0 \u0111\u1EA5u tr\u01B0\u1EDDng c\u1EE7a Hi\u1EC1n Nh\xE2n
    Sett."
  - "C\xE2y c\u1EA7u \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECFng do \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 cu\u1ED9c t\u1EA5n
    c\xF4ng c\u1EE7a c\xE1c th\u1EBF l\u1EF1c t\xE0 \xE1c."
  - "N\u1EBFu mu\u1ED1n qua s\xF4ng v\xE0 th\xE1ch \u0111\u1EA5u v\u1EDBi Th\u1EA7n."
  - "H\xE3y t\u1EF1 t\u1EA1o cho m\xECnh m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc b\xE8 \u0111\u1EC3 qua
    s\xF4ng."
  - "Thu th\u1EADp nguy\xEAn li\u1EC7u t\u1EEB nh\u1EEFng th\u1EF1c v\u1EADt tr\xEAn
    \u0111\u1EA3o v\xE0 t\xF4i s\u1EBD gi\xFAp anh ch\u1EBF t\u1EA1o chi\u1EBFc b\xE8."
